 2|Files from NASA with known IDs|Files with Assessments template missing SDC Commons no value quality assessment|Featured pictures on Wikipedia, Arabic|Square photos of astronomic objects","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"This is an image of the planet <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uranus_(planet)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Uranus (planet)\">Uranus</a> taken by the spacecraft <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyager_2\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Voyager 2\">Voyager 2</a> in 1986. See <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uranus.jpg\" title=\"File:Uranus.jpg\">Uranus.jpg</a> for how Uranus would appear in visible light.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1986-12-16","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20090119235457/http://planetquest.jpl.nasa.gov/milestones_show/slide1.html\">https://web.archive.org/web/20090119235457/http://planetquest.jpl.nasa.gov/milestones_show/slide1.html</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20090419230258/http://planetquest.jpl.nasa.gov/milestones_show/uranus.jpg\">image link</a>)<br><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/catalog/PIA18182\" href=\"https://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/catalog/PIA18182\">http://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/catalog/PIA18182</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/jpeg/PIA18182.jpg\" href=\"https://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/jpeg/PIA18182.jpg\">image link</a>)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"NASA/JPL-Caltech","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-pag